# Route: guide 23 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 43 to 45, 41
# quests, 4.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Elwynn Forest, Alterac Mountains, Westfall, Stranglethorn Vale,
# Stormwind City, The Hinterlands): Goldshire -> Tower of Azora -> Northshire
# Valley -> Tower of Azora -> Chillwind Point -> Gallows' Corner -> Ruins of
# Alterac -> Dalaran -> Strahnbrad -> Gallows' Corner -> Corrahn's Dagger ->
# The Headland -> Lordamere Internment Camp -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Perenolde Tiara (543;
# Grel'borg the Miser 39); The Star, the Hand and the Heart (735; Grel'borg
# the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Starving Arcane (92457), Heart of Disruption (92458), Past
# Due (96800), Past Due (96800), The Defias Brotherhood (166), The Defias
# Brotherhood (166), The Unsent Letter (373), Quell The Uprising (387), Quell
# the Uprising (387), The Color of Blood (388), The Color of Blood (388), The
# Stockade Riots (391), The Stockade Riots (391), Underground Assault (2040),
# Underground Assault (2040), Bring the Light (3636), A Green Sample (92456),
# A Green Sample (92456), Power Overwhelming (92489), Power Overwhelming
# (92489), Jammal'an the Prophet (1446).

